{
    "title": "Dil Mil: South Asian Dating",
    "description": "The premier South Asian dating app around the world, Dil Mil has been featured in Forbes, TechCrunch, India Times! Leading the way, it has been designed for Desi singles in search of authentic connections be it for a relationship, friendship and/or marriage. Experience the excitement and join a lively community of singles globally who share the same background, religion and/or cultural views as you. Whether you\u2019re looking for serious dating that could lead to your dream shaadi or just want to explore the South Asian dating scene, Dil Mil is the option for you to find real connections. \r\n\r\nWith over 30 million matches made and 4 million users spread across the US, Canada, UK, Australia, and India  - it has been the origin point of many South Asian success stories worldwide. Having originally been touted as an Indian dating app, Dil Mil has grown into becoming a global hub for South Asian dating where users identify beyond borders with diverse communities and religions represented such as Gujarati, Punjabi, Sindhi, Bengali, Tamil, Telugu, Malayali, Muslim, Sikh, Christian, Jain, Maharashtrian, Kannada, Rajasthani, and so many more. Dil Mil is more than just an Indian dating app, we help people find their perfect match and build strong relationships with a soulmate.\r\n\r\nChat and date easily knowing that we ensure a real, high-quality community of singles. Photo and data privacy, hands-on support, ethnicity/community filters, Dil Details, and advanced matching algorithms have helped form millions of high-quality matches as well as provided a safe platform for users to enjoy! \r\n\u2219 Phone number sign-in ensures security & avoidance of duplicate or fake profiles. \r\n\u2219 Profile verification also enhances safety by ensuring that our community is made up of real, authentic users.\r\n\r\nTo meet new people, chat and date quicker, use the in-app upgrades and sign up for VIP Elite which gives you access to premium features such as profile boosts, instant matches, unlimited likes, unlimited rewinds, insights, restores and everything you need to chat and date.\r\n\r\nVIP Elite is an optional subscription and if you choose to purchase it, payment will be charged to your Google Play Account. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time by going to your Account Settings after purchase. \r\n\r\nHappy Dil Miling!\r\n\r\n\u2014\r\nSUPPORT\r\nFor in-app chat support, visit your Account screen > click on the top right Settings icon > scroll down to Help & Support.\r\nAlternatively, you can also email us at support@dilmil.co.\r\n\r\n\u2014\r\nSUCCESS STORIES\r\nWe love our success stories! To submit your story and potentially be featured in our #OnceUponaDilMil campaign, please email us at success@dilmil.co.\r\nTo see some of our current success stories, visit dilmil.co/blog \r\n\r\n\u2014\r\nLEGAL\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://dilmil.co/privacy-policy/\r\nTerms of Use: https://dilmil.co/terms-of-use/",
